+---
+id: task-004-hourly-rental
+type: task
+title: "Hourly rental"
+status: pending
+---
+
+# Hourly rental
+
+`addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (non-negative integer cents). `quote` and `book` price a
+rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour at `hours * hourlyPrice`; an item without an
+hourly price throws. Tests first in `test/rental.test.ts` ("hourly rental"). Rules in
+dl-004-hourly-rental-rules.
